<title>USA: Schering-Plough says completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Schering-Plough says completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, N.J. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schering-Plough Corp said Tuesday it had completed its acquisition of the worldwide animal health business of Mallinckrodt Inc for $405 million in cash.</p>
<p>The agreement to acquire Mallinckrodt's animal health business was first announced on May 19, 1997.</p>
